  "description": "Classic 1960’s 3-speed cruisers are some of our favorite bikes. The Daybird takes inspiration from the old bikes we admire and adds in carefully selected modern improvements.\n\nOn the classic side you’ll find Sturmey Archer’s 3-speed hub combined with a durable and intuitive aluminum thumb shifter. The high quality steel frame features a time-proven comfortable riding position.\n\nOn the modern side you’ll find light-weight, polished Aluminum fenders and a chain-guard. The latest version of the Daybird uses traditional 3-piece cranks, a threaded English bottom bracket spec, and tires that are protected by an extra-thick tread. Choose the Daybird as a Standard or Step-thru.\n\nChoose the Daybird as a Standard or Step-Thru.\n\nBoth styles available in Black or Military Blue.",
